<title>USA: Banco O'Higgins names Mobarec as CEO.</title>
<headline>Banco O'Higgins names Mobarec as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco O'Higgins SA said on Monday it had named Francisco Mobarec as chief executive officer, effective October 31.</p>
<p>Mobarec succeeds Fernando Carias Berkowitz, who was recently named deputy chairman of the board of directors of Banco de Santiago.</p>
<p>Berkowitz is responsible for coordinating the merger between Banco O'Higgins and Banco de Santiago, announced in June.</p>
<p>Mobarec was formerly director of credit for OHCH Holding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
